            <i class="fa fa-info-circle me-1"></i>
            Are you sure you want to <strong>VOID</strong> Order #<strong id="pos_void_modal_order_id_text"><%= cart.order_id %></strong>?
            This order will be permanently recorded in the database as <strong>VOID</strong> and excluded from revenue totals.
